(text "G40 interface KEY6; new base GPIO0..7 data,8..11control,14..18audio. Old boards incompatible." (at 15 260 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid 7e29dc99-11ee-5cea-b426-99a687cf08ae))
(text "Base PGA2350 + common PCM1863ADC + PCM5102A; source Core2350B0 + YM2203 + passiveSSG mix." (at 15 265 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid 68b903ac-3a89-5e5c-9755-1904bb5b9a20))
(text "DAC_XSMT = DAC_ALLOW AND LINE_ALLOW; 4ms mute guard, keep audio clocks running on normal STOP." (at 15 270 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid 91b75415-d5fe-5b60-973e-c3ad8d2487da))
(text "ADC IO/core uses PGA3V3, analog/PLL uses AUX; no ADC rail cycling or TMUX. Observe input and rail transients." (at 15 275 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid b93d9e49-3592-55b3-9106-41aa8a7e4a60))
(text "Source control translator also carries YMclock and reset; default OE disabled, RESET pulled low." (at 15 280 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid 9db494ab-4af3-5381-b53d-be7dc3850563))
(text "HOST0x42/100kHz and USB-MIDI/UNO retained as requirements; firmware/PCB/new bench acceptance pending." (at 15 285 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid 5f3ba277-867c-5e27-8e60-f9ca52c3a7e9))
